 "description": "Bir g\u00fcn\u00fcn Resm\u00ee Gazete fihristi: say\u0131 numaras\u0131 ve b\u00f6l\u00fcmlere g\u00f6re (yasama, y\u00fcr\u00fctme ve idare, yarg\u0131, il\u00e2n) yay\u0131mlanan kanun, Cumhurba\u015fkan\u0131 karar\u0131, y\u00f6netmelik, tebli\u011f ve kurul kararlar\u0131n\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131klar\u0131 ve ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131. Table of contents of T\u00fcrkiye's Official Gazette for a day. Tarih verilmezse bug\u00fcn. M\u00fckerrer say\u0131lar bu fihristte yer almaz.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
